[{"title":"和史经 其二","author":"孙邦","text":"宅侧造猪栏，正坐贪秽免。\n巷中堆马粪，而以清贵显。\n二事大不侔，其眼乃能辨。\n吾徒与衲子，相去夫何远。\n祇恐无鼻孔，当知系所践。\n勿谓一瓣香，便解生一善。\n居心苟不净，探洗谩卢扁。\n要令登此堂，摩诘失其□。\n深入不二门，诸臭雪见睍。\n湛然方寸间，众妙来烟篆。\n香销本无事，风静云回卷。\n当年杜陵老，所造宜不浅。\n夜宿赞公房，习气元未殄。\n沉忧觉清梦，岂念世路蹇。\n猪栏马粪辈，皆预公卿选。\n泥涂布渠巷，欲往伤吾跣。\n所以闻妙香，慨叹独辗转。\n此香为谁来，知落处者鲜。\n何如被蒙头，熟寐一觉遣。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中和楼","author":"沈大椿","text":"愁少怜诗酒，閒多忽簿书。\n登楼当白昼，冯槛看清滁。\n风急移凉榻，云归想故庐。\n往来桥上客，谁得见长鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自维扬回仪真","author":"沈大椿","text":"一官安敢问青毡，形影相看祇自怜。\n黄鹄已登清汉去，白鸥空占浅沙眠。\n杏花开遍芜城雨，柳色浑铺瓜渚烟。\n老眼生疏堪自笑，浪惊风物向淮天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自维扬回真州","author":"沈大椿","text":"青蒲短短柳斜斜，入眼新愁乱莫遮。\n雨润固应宜笋蕨，风饕端不贷莺花。\n春来止酒常因病，客里逢人祗问家。\n安得扁舟下荆水，一归老我旧生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扃秀亭 其一","author":"沈大椿","text":"登临兴极未容还，拂拭缁尘扃秀间。\n万事已甘轩鹤老，一身聊拟碛鸥閒。\n滩声犹带湘江水，野色遥分建业山。\n雅志未容归骑促，有情斜日尚苍湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扃秀亭 其二","author":"沈大椿","text":"倦飞山鸟未能还，心在孤云叠嶂间。\n大水雄山须远适，好风佳月自幽閒。\n非关谢傅当年事，何似周郎旧日山。\n安得此心成独往，白鸥盟约在江湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九锁","author":"沈中行","text":"青山倚天分九峰，或踞虎豹蟠蛟龙。\n奔霆白昼鞭玉虹，铁花冰激青濛濛。\n中有浩劫元皇宫，彷佛昆阆双衡嵩。\n洞门谁掣烟霞封，玉鼠石燕巢嵌空。\n列炬仰见仙人踪，枰棋布子局未终。\n冥怀欲唤洪崖翁，共翳紫凤骖飞鸿。\n一笑弱水三万里，他年相见方壶中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"美人","author":"沈云卿","text":"十三学绣傍金窗，十六梳头压大拜。\n色比昭阳人第一，才同江夏士无双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头","author":"沈元实","text":"金关五云里，玉座太微间。\n凌虚新就燕间，宣唤侍臣班。\n丹扆坐移前席，禁漏声传高阁，喜气满龙颜。\n天语眷畴昔，政路稳跻攀。\n酒如渑，香袅穗，寿南山。\n橙黄桔绿，樽前辉映菊花团。\n清晓凉风凝露，晴昼秋光满院，岁岁奉君。\n待看云台画，荣观侈人寰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题储福宫玉真公主像","author":"沈少南","text":"割尽齐封奉鲁元，更开沁水占名园。\n何如帝子空山外，落日骑驴芳草原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书壁四韵","author":"沈长卿","text":"约客探名胜，停辀得所欣。\n山寒多做雨，洞古不收云。\n夜宿听鸣麂，晨炊摘野芹。\n黄冠尤喜事，添炷石炉熏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楚州","author":"沈长卿","text":"楚州淮阴娑罗木，霜露荣倅今何如。\n能令草木死不枯，当时为有北海书。\n荒碑雨侵苔藓湿，尚写墨本传东吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题清芬阁","author":"沈长卿","text":"元英以隐名，务德以仕显。\n人言不同调，是说一何浅。\n丈夫生世间，出处各有意。\n仕以行其道，隐以求其志。\n一以隐为高，伊吕当不起。\n一以仕为乐，夷齐不饿死。\n我观二子心，舒卷如春云。\n邂逅作霖雨，本是版筑君。\n乃祖配子陵，桐江饱风月。\n乃孙拥麾幢，遗爱浃闽粤。\n相望二百年，家学留青编。\n冥鸿与栖凤，进退两俱贤。\n秋冬享烝尝，瞻像不泚颡。\n独抱元成经，肯作世南匠。\n种田刈禾黍，种圃收兰芝。\n请诵裳华篇，有之以似之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"沈长卿","text":"瑞气氤氲入绛纱。\n水沉香荐碧流霞。\n疏梅欲破风前蕊，冷菊犹开霜后花。\n销粉黛，减铅华。\n药炉经卷好生涯。\n络滨侍从他年贵，便是蟠桃王母家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"沈长卿","text":"翠蛾环坐忆洲钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沧浪亭","author":"沈东","text":"草蔓花枝与世新，登临空复想清尘。\n只今唯有亭前水，曾识春风载酒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翠蛟峰","author":"沈平","text":"谁解青云勒，在蛟舞不休。\n飞来两潭月，惊起九峰秋。\n松影晴犹暗，山光暖欲浮。\n因参玉局句，千古仰前修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题静斋稿","author":"沈平","text":"斯道在人心，如蚌藏圆珠。\n散作明月光，敛则止水虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"沈平","text":"还君此画不忍觑，怕忆当年分手处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"涪州得山胡次子由韵","author":"苏轼","text":"终日锁筠笼，回头惜翠茸。\n谁知声㗲㗲，亦自意重重。\n夜宿烟生浦，朝鸣日上峰。\n故巢何足恋，鹰隼岂能容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题仙都观","author":"苏轼","text":"山前江水流浩浩，山上苍苍松柏老。\n舟中行客去纷纷，古今换易如秋草。\n空山楼观何峥嵘，真人王远、阴长生。\n飞符御气朝百灵，悟道不复诵《黄庭》。\n龙车虎驾来下迎，去如旋风抟紫清。\n真人厌世不回顾，世间生死如朝暮。\n学仙度世岂无人，餐霞绝粒长苦辛。\n安得独从逍遥君，泠然乘风驾浮云，超世无有我独存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙都山鹿","author":"苏轼","text":"日月何促促，尘世苦局束。\n仙子去无踪，故山遗白鹿。\n仙人已去鹿无家，孤栖怅望层城霞。\n至今闻有游洞客，夜来江市叫平沙。\n长松千树风萧瑟，仙宫去人无咫尺。\n夜鸣白鹿安在哉，满山秋草无行迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酹江月/念奴娇","author":"沈刚孙","text":"我来访古。\n把尘襟、都付一声鸣橹。\n笑把瑶觞波浩荡，却忆长鲸吞吐。\n坐挹高风，骨清毛冷，不作嚣尘语。\n客星何在，谩留遗像江渚。\n试问泽畔羊裘，当时何事，笑禹弇宫武。\n金印貂蝉谁不爱，只为汗颜巢许。\n幸有高台，较他箕颍，未肯轻输与。\n酒酣长啸，翩然谁共飞举。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秀野园","author":"沈庄可","text":"西京五亩园，花木秀而野。\n坡仙作此诗，盛事记司马。\n深夜独乐堂，气象极闲雅。\n晚芳相元祐，勋名动夷夏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题分宜上松晚香堂","author":"沈庄可","text":"魏公判相州，始作昼锦堂。\n老圃秋色淡，自爱晚节香。\n怡斋怀紫绶，得诰归故乡。\n葺圃承祖志，构堂先庐傍。\n命名仰前哲，阔步追遗芳。\n人生随分定，鹏鴳自殊翔。\n富贵任适志，馀暇聊徜徉。\n譬彼兰与菊，托根花卉场。\n荣枯有迟速，代谢从暄凉。\n百年倏过半，须发各已苍。\n多情感会别，聚散安可常。\n非惟隔今古，况复阅兴亡。\n何以消我忧，一醉万虑忘。\n季子久颠沛，买臣早疏狂。\n累累暮年印，得失宁相偿。\n何如光霁时，呼客同举觞。\n静中猿鸟乐，闲处日月长。\n愿坚岁寒操，有如傲霜黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望海潮","author":"沈伯文","text":"山连嵩岱，疆分齐鲁，济南自古多奇月。\n魄堕英星，芒剪瑞□，来参汉主龙飞。\n仙露浥繁枝。\n振家声赫奕，金印传龟。\n一种春风，后园桃李自成蹊。\n淮堧暂弭旌旗。\n庆歌浮绿野，人静圜扉。\n梅破粉痕，柳回星眼，相将紫诏催归。\n玉勒晓骢嘶。\n望天墀咫尺，香惹朝衣。\n最好朱颜绿发，劝宴凤凰池。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解印至大桥铺寄邵阳父老","author":"沈伯达","text":"已过长亭一舍宽，送行犹自挽征鞍。\n我无惠政苏凋瘵，何事邦人泪不乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月十七夜寄邢子友","author":"陈与义","text":"暑雨虽不足，凉风还有馀。\n乐此城阴夜，何殊山崦居。\n月明苍桧立，露下芭蕉舒。\n试问澄虚阁，今夕复焉如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哀扇工歌","author":"沈作哲","text":"某州竹扇名字著，织扇供官困追捕。\n使君开府未浃旬，欲戴纶巾挥白羽。\n新模巧制旋剪裁，百中无一中程度。\n犀革镌柄出虫鱼，麝煤熏纸生烟雾。\n蕺山老姥羞翰墨，汉宫佳人掩纨素。\n衙内白取知何名，帐下雄拿不知数。\n供输不办箠楚频，一朝赴水将谁诉。\n使君崇重了不闻，呜呼何以慰黎庶。\n闻道园家卖菜翁，又说江头打鱼户。\n号令亟下须所无，官不与钱期限遽。\n归来痛哭辞妻儿，宿昔投缳挂枯树。\n一双婉婉良家子，吏兵夺取名为顾。\n弟兄号叫邻里惊，两家吞声丧其妪。\n死者已矣可奈何，冤魂成群空号呼。\n杀人纵欲势位尊，贪残无道天所怒。\n邦人蓄愤不敢言，君其拊马章台路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新安采樵行","author":"沈作哲","text":"种粟上山椒，种禾水没腰。\n田家作苦不如樵，炊桂之地甚不遥。\n一艘千束莫复朝，顺风顺水不动桡。\n归来醉饱吹短箫，野花插鬓樵女娇。\n农夫忍饥自芸苗，粟米自熟腹自枵。\n明年卖田卖山去，谁能辛苦输王赋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73485,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高士峰","author":"沈希尹","text":"淡淡梨花寂寂春，一声啼鸟隔花闻。\n高峰影转金鸡月，渤海晴横碧峤云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73486,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亦爱堂","author":"童宗说","text":"吾家小院千里驹，眉宇照人自秀整。\n平生尚友康山陶，拔俗翩翩有高骋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73487,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中赠张玉娘","author":"沈佺","text":"隔水度仙妃，清绝云争飞。\n娇花羞秀质，秋月见寒辉。\n高情春不染，心境尘难依。\n何当饮云液，共跨双鸾归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73488,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏瑟师","author":"沈宏甫","text":"宇宙浩浩谁诗鸣，遗响阒寂如英茎。\n更无高谈细论者，唐末婀娜江西清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73489,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头","author":"沈明叔","text":"汉事正犹豫，足迹正跫然。\n严陵老子，当时底事动天顽。\n曾把丝纶一掷，藐视山河九鼎，高议凛人寒。\n竹帛非吾事，霄汉任腾骞。\n问云台，还得似，钓台巅。\n几年山下，使人犹识汉衣冠。\n寄语功名馀子，今日成尘何在，百战亦多艰。\n一笑桐江上，来往钓名船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73490,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百福寺薰风堂孝丰县东门","author":"沈枢","text":"筑室最高处，轩窗八面通。\n凿山流乳液，开户纳薰风。\n巾履随凉设，茶瓜与客同。\n我来资解愠，不羡楚王雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73491,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"沈枢","text":"沽酒频留客，围棋不计功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73492,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏莎行 赠杨蟠","author":"沈注","text":"竹阁云深，巢虚人阒。\n几年湖上音尘寂。\n风流今有使君家，月明夜夜闻双笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73493,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月一日","author":"沈规","text":"门外行蹊落叶遮，西风寒入野人家。\n重阳日近秋光足，开遍闲庭帝女花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过瑩公房","author":"沈规","text":"悟得楞伽理，尘函久不开。\n游丝瑩定石，驯雀下生台。\n境寂从朝暮，心空了去来。\n行看旧庭柏，自说少时栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游都梁赋","author":"沈诚","text":"昔中原兮今边头，抱良图兮气干牛。\n窥泗城兮辨古汴，临清浦兮思白沟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73496,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二郎山","author":"沈括","text":"二郎山下雪纷纷，旋卓穹庐学塞人。\n化尽素衣冬末老，石烟多似洛阳尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73497,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开元乐词 其一","author":"沈括","text":"鹳鹊楼头日暖，蓬莱殿里花香。\n草绿烟迷步辇，天高日近龙床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73498,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开元乐词 其四","author":"沈括","text":"殿后春旗簇仗，楼前御队穿花。\n一片红云闹处，外人遥认官家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73499,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开元乐词 其二","author":"沈括","text":"楼上正临宫外，人间不见仙家。\n寒食轻烟薄雾，满城明月梨花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73500,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开元乐词 其三","author":"沈括","text":"按舞骊山影里，回銮渭水光中。\n玉笛一天明月，翠华满陌东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73501,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无讼堂诗","author":"沈昭远","text":"欲为袁人雪谤声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73502,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"臞庵","author":"沈某","text":"清江绕槛白鸥飞，坐看潮痕上钓矶。\n松菊未荒元亮径，芰荷先制屈平衣。\n窗前枫叶晓初落，亭下鲈鱼秋正肥。\n安得从君理蓑笠，棹歌相趁入烟霏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73503,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安石岭","author":"沈说","text":"茅屋鸡声勘夜分，杖藜挑月带馀醺。\n不知身在孤峰顶，回首人家尽白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73504,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"沈说","text":"耳根听不歇，滴滴冷于秋。\n疑是山翁醉，岩前枕瀑流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73505,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纸衾三首 其三","author":"沈说","text":"一幅新裁碧涧冰，野人留客宿云层。\n山房恰好松醪熟，夜半无眠话葛藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73506,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纸衾三首 其二","author":"沈说","text":"茧面新乾带露揉，春回斗帐伴吟愁。\n残年已办蒙头过，风雪从教打戍楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73507,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纸衾三首 其一","author":"沈说","text":"碎捣霜藤月下砧，清泉泻出簟纹匀。\n老翁采药归来晚，剪得山南半段云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73508,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明融盆池二首 其二","author":"沈说","text":"老瓦盆深漾细萍，雨多流却半瓣青。\n夜凉偶出庭心看，缺处光涵三两星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73509,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明融盆池二首 其一","author":"沈说","text":"凉入湘帘影半开，小窗午枕梦初回。\n萧疏数叶秋菰上，也解声声报雨来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73510,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"沈说","text":"山束江流起素湍，羊裘立尽暮云寒。\n早知钩饵成虚设，多却当时一钓竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73511,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春词","author":"沈说","text":"水涨寒沟柳又阴，小窗风度一声禽。\n若将离绪萦春事，片片飞花是客心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73512,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺词 其一","author":"沈说","text":"密幄香烧锦瑟横，佳人半醉觉寒轻。\n忽思塞下新番曲，弹作黄芦孤雁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73513,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺词 其二","author":"沈说","text":"冬事侵寻浑未知，隔邻听得理寒衣。\n惊心步出庭西曲，日影斜斜木叶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73514,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"沈说","text":"读罢黄庭一卷经，磬残烟冷夜坛清。\n月明何处人开户，惊起松梢睡鹤鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73515,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"沈说","text":"白头何计是生涯，日日樽前卧落花。\n绿满池塘无一梦，夜来风雨过谁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中秋兴","author":"沈说","text":"山户少曾扃，居贫易得清。\n秋衣和月卧，溪茗杂云烹。\n学字书红叶，看骚些落英。\n从他头早白，心事本和平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯公岭","author":"沈说","text":"晓上冯公岭，艰难见客情。\n雨和残叶落，身逐乱云行。\n野店山腰出，秋泉石罅生。\n若将世途比，此路更为平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"买舟","author":"沈说","text":"租得舟如叶，低低半搭篷。\n仅堪容野客，还喜友渔翁。\n溯水斜分浪，悬崖逆斗风。\n去程应不计，且泊槿花丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73519,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵古愚立冬日观菊","author":"沈说","text":"闲绕篱头看菊花，深黄浅紫自窠窠。\n清于檐卜香尤耐，韵比猗兰色更多。\n九节番疑今日是，一樽未觉晚秋过。\n从教白发须簪遍，且任当筵作笑歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73520,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵永堂","author":"沈说","text":"莺声未改春，叶底一蝉新。\n幻境老无梦，醉乡诗有神。\n整巾因把镜，懒语怕逢人。\n似此衰迟者，劳君料理频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73521,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]